# FrankenRobotics
#
# The repository is at plan stage. These rules also cover the layout the base plan
# specifies (plan §26.1), so the first Cargo workspace, GPU annexes, Lean project and
# viewer land without build output or private data leaking into commits.

# === Rust build output ===
# Matches every workspace: core, spark/ (GPU annexes), surface/ (MCP), derive/, apps/.
target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo runs through the build-offload shim into ${RCH_TARGET_BASE:-$TMPDIR}, never in-tree
# (plan §26.7). Worker-local target trees and stray compiler output are a backstop.
.rch-target/
.rch-target-*/
*.rlib
*.rmeta
rustc-ice-*.txt
# Keep Cargo.lock tracked: frob, frobd and frob-mcp are binaries and every result names its inputs.

# === GPU build products and kernel caches ===
# Derived kernel *sources* (Rust + shared dialect) are checked in with their digests
# (plan §20.3). Compiled device code is a cache keyed by compiler and driver: never commit it.
*.ptx
*.cubin
*.fatbin
*.metallib
*.air
/.kernel-cache/
/kernel-cache/

# === Lean (lean/ is a Lake project; outputs are not committed, plan §26.1) ===
.lake/
lean/build/
*.olean
*.ilean

# === Viewer (Three.js replay pages) ===
node_modules/
/viewer/dist/

# === Runs, telemetry and replays are user data, not source ===
/runs/
/out/
/telemetry/
/chronicle/
/replays/
*.npz
*.crashpack
/crashpacks/
/artifacts/

# === Private places stay private (plan §29.3) ===
# Scan-derived scene packs, walkthrough videos and anything derived from them live under a
# private root outside this repository. These rules are the backstop.
/private/
*.private.json
*.private.*
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.heic
*.HEIC

# === Planning reproduction bundle ===
# Unzip planning/astra-10x-reproduction.zip into an empty directory outside the repo.
# If it is unpacked here by mistake, keep the copy out of commits.
/astra-10x-reproduction/
/repro/

# === Python (planning reproduction scripts, oracle capture tooling) ===
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# === Profiling and benchmarks ===
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph*.svg
/criterion/
/bench-output/

# === Golden-artifact sidecars (review the diff, then re-bless) ===
*.actual
*.snap.new

# === Agent tooling state ===
# NTM swarm session state and hook receipts (any depth, e.g. planning/duel/.ee/).
.ntm/
.ee/
.bv/
.rch/
.doctor/
.agent-mail-project-id
.agent-mail.yaml
.claude/settings.local.json
SESSION_*.md
# Beads recovery artifacts (the tracker's own files under .beads/ stay tracked)
.beads/*.orphan_*
.beads/*.corrupt_*
.beads/*.pre_recovery_*
.beads/*.backup_*
.beads/*.rebuild_*
.beads/recovery*/

# === Secrets and local settings ===
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# === OS / editor ===
.DS_Store
._*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.tmp
*.bak
